          "html": "weber REP 25 is a buildable repair mortar (PCC) with plastic fibre for repairing concrete without formwork, outdoors and indoors. It is mixed with water only and gives a ready-to-use mortar with good strength and normally good adhesion and durability. Intended for concrete of normal strength, at least about 20 MPa.",
          "gen": true
